---
// 안내 글 링크 누름 (brief handoff/ARCHITECT-BRIEF-REV3.md Decision 6): counts presses of the guide's affiliate block
// (.out-links[data-guide], src/components/OutLinks.astro) as out with t = the guide's tools[0] and g = its slug.
// src/layouts/Guide.astro renders this only when the guide has a block and PUBLIC_USAGE_STATS=1, so every other page
// ships no extra script. src/lib/ui/guide-out.ts explains why it does not import usage.ts (the guide JS budget).
// Astro emits the chunk in every build, referenced by no page unless rendered; __USAGE_STATS__ empties it when the
// statistics are off (check-dist: no beacon code then). Guides are not precached, so neither is this chunk.
---
<script>
  import { bindGuideOut } from '../lib/ui/guide-out';

  if (__USAGE_STATS__) bindGuideOut();
</script>
